Auto-Commit Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant AutoCommitService
    participant Git

    Agent->>AutoCommitService: RunPostToolsHook(completed_tools)
    AutoCommitService->>AutoCommitService: Check for mutating tools

    alt Mutating tools succeeded
        AutoCommitService->>Git: git status --porcelain
        Git-->>AutoCommitService: Changed files

        alt Changes detected
            AutoCommitService->>AutoCommitService: Generate commit message
            AutoCommitService->>Git: git add <files>
            AutoCommitService->>Git: git commit -m "message"
            Git-->>AutoCommitService: Commit SHA
            AutoCommitService-->>Agent: Success(sha)
        else No changes
            AutoCommitService-->>Agent: Skipped
        end
    else No mutating tools
        AutoCommitService-->>Agent: Skipped
    end

    Agent->>Agent: Continue conversation